# DevSecOps

**DevSecOps** คือการฝัง security เข้าไปในทุก stage ของ SDLC แบบ **shift-left + automation** — ให้ pipeline เป็นคนจับ vulnerability ก่อน attacker หรือ human audit [3875][3879][3888]

## Security Pipeline

```text
Commit → Secret Scan → SAST → SCA → Build → Container Scan → IaC Scan → DAST → Deploy → Runtime
```

| Stage | Control |
|---|---|
| **Commit** [3875][3880] | Secret scan [3875][3880] |
| **Build** [3875][3880] | SAST + SCA [3875][3880] |
| **Image** [3876][3880] | Container scan [3876][3880] |
| **Infra** [3875][3880] | IaC scan [3875][3880] |
| **Runtime** [3875][3880] | DAST + monitor [3875][3880] |

ใช้ pipeline นี้เพื่อ shift-left [3875][3880][3888]

